{"ts": 0.03446, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.035801, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 252}
{"ts": 0.035864, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mStage 4: Commands and streams\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSix short lessons, then a task. You'll read a command's parts, then\r\njoin commands together and send what they print into files.\r\n", "len": 174}
{"ts": 0.035913, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for lesson 4.1.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 54}
{"ts": 0.038948, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.039211, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.039233, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.052219, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.052331, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.052362, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.057203, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.058474, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.1\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.058515, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.058585, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mThe parts of a command\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nA command line is a name, then options, then arguments.\r\n", "len": 94}
{"ts": 0.058617, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mwc -l poem.txt\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# name wc, option -l, argument poem.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"hello world\"\u001b[0m     \u001b[90m# one argument, because of the quotes\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# asks where a program lives, if it exists\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mcommand -v\u001b[0m prints a path when the program is installed, and nothing\r\nwhen it is not.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try all three, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 411}
{"ts": 0.061694, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.061957, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.074879, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.074988, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "wc -l poem.txt\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.075015, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "wc -l poem.txt\r\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.075033, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 9}
{"ts": 0.077069, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "       4 poem.txt\r\n", "len": 19}
{"ts": 0.077343, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.077394, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "echo \"hello world\"\n", "len": 19}
{"ts": 0.077438, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "echo \"hello world\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.07746, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "hello world\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.077543, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.077575, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v vim\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.077611, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v vim\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.077697, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "/usr/bin/vim\r\n", "len": 14}
{"ts": 0.077768, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.077796, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.077818, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "next\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.082257, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.083519, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.2\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.083553, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.083617, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSpaces and quotes\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThe shell splits a line on spaces. Quote a name that has a space.\r\n", "len": 99}
{"ts": 0.083644, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch my notes.txt\u001b[0m       \u001b[90m# two files: my, and notes.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mtouch \"my notes.txt\"\u001b[0m     \u001b[90m# one file with a space in its name\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nIt is the same for every command: \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m would open two\r\nfiles; \u001b[92mvim \"my notes.txt\"\u001b[0m opens one.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try them, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 370}
{"ts": 0.086666, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.086927, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
