{"ts": 0.234441, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "First, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[1mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 111}
{"ts": 0.236543, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
