{"ts": 0.24, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\r\n", "len": 85}
{"ts": 0.240046, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "the path to vim\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.240072, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 46}
{"ts": 0.249108, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.252224, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\r\n", "len": 82}
{"ts": 0.252283, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.252307, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m > overwrites, >> appends\r\n", "len": 55}
{"ts": 0.261146, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.264439, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\r\n", "len": 89}
{"ts": 0.264496, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\n", "len": 21}
{"ts": 0.264522, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m because of the space\r\n", "len": 51}
